                            5
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَحَّى</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He,</i> or <i>it, removed; withdrew; went,</i>
or <i>moved, away,</i> or <i>aside;</i> (Msb;) or <i>retired to
a distance.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَحَّى</span> (TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قعر</span>,) signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكلّف ان يتكلّم كلامًا نَحْوِيًّا</span>, i. e. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكلّف</span>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">التكلّم على طريق النحاة</span>. (IbrD.)

